This method is called in a loop on std\+::vector$<$\+G\+Ldata$>$ my\+\_\+v\+\_\+\+M\+D\+E\+\_\+data within init\+\_\+glyph(). At each iteration a mde\+\_\+member name or data of class std\+::string is processed. During each of these iteration create\+\_\+coord\+\_\+vector\+\_\+text loops through each character of the string from first to last. calculating vertices and texture coordinates respectively pushing back in vectors glyphs\+\_\+vertex and glyphs\+\_\+box. It also pushes back the number of glyphs per text in vector nb\+\_\+glyphs\+\_\+per\+\_\+text. 

